the \"All That Jazz\", but we opted for the shrimp and oyster poboy instead since my boyfriend and I both love seafood and oysters and fried things. The sandwich is big and definitely splittable between two. The shrimp and oysters are both perfectly fried and not too oily but have the perfect amount of crunch. The dressing on the san..."},{"business_id":"FaY_9x8ZtsuHe5wS2iJM1Q","review_id":"N605D4HsjYSohIPz3E2qaQ","date":"2012-09-29T22:07:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9466687440872192,"text_excerpt":"Amazing po boys, total dive, but super friendly. This place has a sandwich list that goes on forever, but everything I ate off of it--four different sandwiches--was amazing. All sandwiches either come on a bun--and a surprisingly good one--or a french bread roll which is 2-3 times the size of the bun, but has about twice the meat. I personally think I prefer the buns, but to each their own. The french bread isn't a crusty baguette like I'd hoped, but more of a long hoagie roll. My favorite so far is the fried oysters, but the 'all that jazz' sandwich including shrimp, turkey and ham with tangy sauce and cheese was probably a close second. They also deliver anywhere in the french quarter a..."},{"business_id":"FaY_9x8ZtsuHe5wS2iJM1Q","review_id":"HprvD7UMo_VbZiRPjfXs5A","date":"2019-01-12T04:59:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9406026005744934,"text_excerpt":"All That Jazz Po'Boy is probably one of the best sandwiches I've eaten.. With that said- the place is a sort of sketchy-hole-in-the-wall deli. Staff pretty much keep to themselves, not too interactive. There is nowhere to sit, it is meant for take and go. Order first, then pay (cash only-atm inside) when your food arrives. They have an expansive menu with so many sandwich options I wish we ordered a breakfast, lunch, and dinner haha. They have loads of sides in the deli counter window that look delicious (though we didnt opt for a side). I got the All That Jazz and my hubby the Shrimp Po Boy. The jazz had the most unique bold flavor burst, with delicious seasoning melted into the cheeses...."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FaY_9x8ZtsuHe5wS2iJM1Q","photo_id":"VIt49aTP2ni397GnLcJrVw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/VIt49aTP2ni397GnLcJrVw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8577291965484619},{"business_id":"FaY_9x8ZtsuHe5wS2iJM1Q","photo_id":"IN3XAGRepHF8PfEBDD-L1w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/IN3XAGRepHF8PfEBDD-L1w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8542267680168152},{"business_id":"FaY_9x8ZtsuHe5wS2iJM1Q","photo_id":"vtLSCyYFNZ_cTLVAKWJq0g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vtLSCyYFNZ_cTLVAKWJq0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8286781311035156},{"business_id":"FaY_9x8ZtsuHe5wS2iJM1Q","photo_id":"C0MY7qpVEm7R-0xhjWAsEw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/C0MY7qpVEm7R-0xhjWAsEw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8108135461807251},{"business_id":"FaY_9x8ZtsuHe5wS2iJM1Q","photo_id":"I8Pv2pq6pRQ6nmpbxdX3sg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/I8Pv2pq6pRQ6nmpbxdX3sg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7613757848739624}]},"notebook_case":null}
